  (2,3): m_0 in h_[alpha:beta]  <=>  alpha = beta   (on the phase generator: 2*I*(alpha - beta) = 0)
  (3,3): m_0 in h_[alpha:beta]  <=>  alpha = beta   (on the phase generator: 3*I*(alpha - beta) = 0)
