  (3,4): m_0 in h_[alpha:beta]  <=>  alpha = beta   (on the phase generator: 3*I*(alpha - beta) = 0)
  in eps-labels the matchings are theta_eps^{-1}(m_0) = {(zeta^(e1), (conj zeta + 0)^(e2))}:
  at (2,2),(2,3),(3,3) for all four eps: the labels act on L as the same operators, and lie in the Letter's
  h_W iff e1 = e2, i.e. exactly when the selection is that of reading A  (asserted)
(d) h cap stab at (2,3), as in Thm S-stabilizer; operator pairs, so reading A is h_+ = {tr1+tr2=0}, A* is h_- = {tr1-tr2=0}:
